{"title": "Break the Unbroken", "pageid": 27972, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Break_the_Unbroken", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Break the Unbroken</b> is a passive feature that increase damage against undamaged targets.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> to targets that still have all their <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">hit points</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shortsword_of_First_Blood\" title=\"Shortsword of First Blood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Shortsword_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shortsword_of_First_Blood\" title=\"Shortsword of First Blood\">Shortsword of First Blood</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The additional damage is only added to weapons with Break the Unbroken.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204729\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1126/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9863/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2988/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754699/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.740      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   34.740      1 -total\n 35.33%   12.272      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 30.57%   10.6